{"slug":"Universal-Script-keystrokes-Without-Arrows-5603","_id":"631a33b33c4dacc6197d214c","title":"Keystrokes v3","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":"/images/sb/1804800-1662661555264.jpg","placeId":0},"features":"Couldn't get the whole photo to fit, but this features things such as:\nKeys per second, Fps, and Cps for both the left and right mouse buttons.\n\nExamples of them: https://gyazo.com/a0e27997458b50e7a1680ca641d7a817\n\nCustomization Coming soon!\n\nWhich keys can be changed using the options below?\n\nFor a complete list of keycodes, use: https://developer.roblox.com/en-us/api-reference/enum/KeyCode\n\nPs: some keycodes might not work\n\nUpdate log:\n\n-> Fixed kps not picking up key presses, and custom binds,\n-> Added an ms counter\n-> Added an option to toggle for a backdrop, ms counter, kps counter, fps counter, and animated shadow. This can only be used when re-ran for now.\n-> Added arrows\n-> Fixed the extreme lag\nComing soon:\n -> Arrow support and other features\n-> Custom color of the keys -- Currently default gray\n\nBugs: \nCharMs: Currently Broken","tags":[],"script":"getgenv().k1 = \"W\"\ngetgenv().k2 = \"A\"\ngetgenv().k3 =  \"S\"\ngetgenv().k4 = \"D\"\n\ngetgenv().backdrop = false -- only if you want the shadow bg.\ngetgenv().showms = true -- only if you want to have your ms shown.\ngetgenv().showfps = true -- only if you want to have your fps shown.\ngetgenv().showkps = true -- only if you want to have your kps shown.\ngetgenv().animated = true -- only if you want the GUI to have the animated shadow.\ngetgenv().showarrows = false -- only if you want arrow keys to be shown.\ngetgenv().keydrag = false -- only if you want the keys to be draggable, can also be buggy, will be worked on in the future.\ngetgenv().mschar = true -- only if you want an extra ms counter to be shown on your character, feature suggested by @hiff\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Zirmith/Util-Tools/main/keys\"))()\n\n","owner":{"_id":"622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d","username":"_R0ver","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d-1731609423819.png","status":"offline","id":"622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"views":32725,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2022-09-08T18:25:55.292Z","dislikeCount":0,"likeCount":1,"image":"/images/sb/1804800-1662661555264.jpg","executes":121,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4b950","editBy":{"_id":"622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d","username":"_R0ver","status":"offline","id":"622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2022-09-08T18:29:29.295Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4b951","editBy":{"_id":"622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d","username":"_R0ver","status":"offline","id":"622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2022-09-08T18:30:00.145Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4b952","editBy":{"_id":"622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d","username":"_R0ver","status":"offline","id":"622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2022-09-08T19:32:56.561Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4b953","editBy":{"_id":"622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d","username":"_R0ver","status":"offline","id":"622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2022-09-08T19:45:48.331Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4b954","editBy":{"_id":"622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d","username":"_R0ver","status":"offline","id":"622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2022-09-09T13:45:07.602Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4b955","editBy":{"_id":"622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d","username":"_R0ver","status":"offline","id":"622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2022-09-09T13:45:41.114Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4b956","editBy":{"_id":"622e86fdf3174fa2457af49d"